# FlowTree — Auth
# Extensão REST Client (VS Code). Faça o login abaixo e cole o `token` da resposta em @token.

@host = http://localhost:5100/api
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### Login (admin semeado)
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@flowtree.test",
  "password": "password"
}

### Login (usuário comum — módulo tasks)
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "dev@flowtree.test",
  "password": "password"
}

### Usuário autenticado (com módulos)
GET {{host}}/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Renovar o token (aceita token expirado dentro dos 14 dias)
POST {{host}}/refresh
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Esqueci a senha (resposta sempre genérica)
POST {{host}}/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@flowtree.test"
}

### Redefinir a senha (token vem do e-mail — em dev, no storage/logs/laravel.log)
POST {{host}}/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "token": "TOKEN_DO_EMAIL",
  "email": "admin@flowtree.test",
  "password": "novaSenha123",
  "password_confirmation": "novaSenha123"
}

### Autorizar canal do Reverb (o Echo faz isso sozinho)
POST {{host}}/broadcasting/auth
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "socket_id": "123456.789012",
  "channel_name": "private-project.COLE_O_UUID_DO_PROJETO"
}

### Logout (blacklist do token)
POST {{host}}/logout
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
